---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LinkButton from "@components/LinkButton.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <div class="space-y-8 lg:space-y-10">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <h1
        class="font-serif text-[2rem] leading-tight font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] lg:text-[2.5rem]"
      >
        Journey
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted max-w-[36rem] text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed">
        Welcome! Journey is an empathy-based learning tool that houses Trauma
        Informed Care cases regarding vulnerable populations.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="narrative border-rule space-y-5 border-t pt-8 lg:space-y-6">
      <p>
        The Trauma-informed approach to healthcare recognizes the impact of
        adverse experiences and social determinants of health on physical and
        mental wellbeing. Health does not start inside the doctor's office.
        These cases are meant to challenge us to put ourselves in the shoes of
        our patients and better understand the barriers that they face when
        seeking healthcare or managing adverse health conditions.
      </p>

      <p>
        By using this tool, we hope to empower healthcare providers to craft
        inclusive healthcare solutions for our patients who belong to these
        populations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <LinkButton variant="primary" href="/journeys" text="View all Journeys" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
